1
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:33,000
"Bittersweet Love"

2
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:38,000
(Episode 8)

3
00:01:40,791 --> 00:01:42,540
You're so much trouble.

4
00:01:42,541 --> 00:01:43,333
I'd already lined up a movie date

5
00:01:43,334 --> 00:01:44,791
with a girl this weekend.

6
00:01:45,333 --> 00:01:46,333
I never even invited you.

7
00:01:47,333 --> 00:01:48,708
You're so ungrateful.

8
00:01:49,416 --> 00:01:51,375
You know who my date was gonna be?

9
00:01:52,375 --> 00:01:54,208
Director Ding's daughter.

10
00:01:55,541 --> 00:01:56,541
You mean Deputy Director?

11
00:01:56,958 --> 00:01:57,958
From the Textile Bureau?

12
00:01:58,708 --> 00:02:00,000
I met him once at the Beis’.

13
00:02:00,375 --> 00:02:01,916
Can't you at least wish me well?

14
00:02:02,708 --> 00:02:04,208
I'm getting confirmed next month.

15
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:06,000
Director Ding said so himself.

16
00:02:07,083 --> 00:02:08,208
When we finish eating,

17
00:02:08,791 --> 00:02:10,583
grab an invoice when you settle the bill.

18
00:02:11,125 --> 00:02:12,845
Have it written up as promotional supplies.

19
00:02:17,291 --> 00:02:18,374
Your brother's

20
00:02:18,375 --> 00:02:20,333
a totally different man now.

21
00:02:20,625 --> 00:02:21,832
When I go out these days,

22
00:02:21,833 --> 00:02:23,708
everyone's scrambling
to curry favor with me.

23
00:02:28,791 --> 00:02:29,791
Do you know who this is?

24
00:02:34,166 --> 00:02:35,708
You'll be shocked when I tell you.

25
00:02:36,625 --> 00:02:39,291
The Client Manager at Langjian Securities

26
00:02:39,708 --> 00:02:40,708
Do you know Langjian?

27
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:42,541
There are ten brokerages nationwide,

28
00:02:43,208 --> 00:02:45,168
and Langjian accounts
for more than five of them.

29
00:02:45,541 --> 00:02:47,708
Even Director Ding kowtows to them.

30
00:02:47,875 --> 00:02:49,541
If they merely throw you a bone,

31
00:02:49,791 --> 00:02:50,833
you'll strike it rich.

32
00:02:53,583 --> 00:02:55,208
Uncle Bei's high-ranking,

33
00:02:55,750 --> 00:02:57,510
but immediate authority
carries more weight.

34
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:59,500
If it's a real way to make money.

35
00:03:00,583 --> 00:03:01,903
This time we have a benefactor...

36
00:03:04,791 --> 00:03:05,791
Xiaofan.

37
00:03:07,541 --> 00:03:08,750
I was just thinking about you.

38
00:03:08,916 --> 00:03:11,250
Didn't think I'd see you so soon.

39
00:03:11,625 --> 00:03:12,041
Ah.
Hello.

40
00:03:12,833 --> 00:03:15,083
I'm Xiaoping, Xiaofan's elder brother. And
you?

41
00:03:17,500 --> 00:03:18,500
I'm Lu Tao.

42
00:03:18,916 --> 00:03:19,976
I've met your brother before.

43
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:20,416
Oh.

44
00:03:20,833 --> 00:03:21,833
Please, have a seat.

45
00:03:25,708 --> 00:03:26,708
Lu Tao.

46
00:03:31,625 --> 00:03:32,625
Mr. Lu.

47
00:03:34,958 --> 00:03:35,958
Sit.

48
00:03:39,833 --> 00:03:40,833
Xiaofan.

49
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:42,791
You opened an account there last time,

50
00:03:42,916 --> 00:03:44,116
but never returned after that.

51
00:03:45,125 --> 00:03:45,958
I even had staff

52
00:03:45,959 --> 00:03:47,319
set up a VIP trading room for you.

53
00:03:50,291 --> 00:03:52,416
I don't have much funds.

54
00:03:53,708 --> 00:03:54,708
What?

55
00:03:55,333 --> 00:03:57,375
Doesn't Lüqing trust his own brother?

56
00:03:58,916 --> 00:03:59,916
Don't you worry.

57
00:04:00,208 --> 00:04:02,583
Your money's safe with me.

58
00:04:02,916 --> 00:04:05,208
Not a soul will get wind of this.

59
00:04:07,541 --> 00:04:08,741
It has nothing to do with him.

60
00:04:09,416 --> 00:04:10,656
I just wanted to trade for fun,

61
00:04:11,375 --> 00:04:12,625
so I opened an account.

62
00:04:12,833 --> 00:04:15,000
There's not even ten thousand yuan in
there.

63
00:04:17,708 --> 00:04:18,708
Who is that?

64
00:04:19,291 --> 00:04:20,416
General Manager of Langjian.

65
00:04:20,833 --> 00:04:21,833
Lu Tao.

66
00:04:22,583 --> 00:04:23,583
Mr. Lu.

67
00:04:24,041 --> 00:04:25,041
Oh my.

68
00:04:25,541 --> 00:04:27,624
My apologies, my sincere respects.

69
00:04:27,625 --> 00:04:28,708
My deepest respects.

70
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:31,208
Your reputation precedes you.

71
00:04:31,333 --> 00:04:33,208
I just couldn't place you for a moment.

72
00:04:33,333 --> 00:04:34,875
Please don't say that.

73
00:04:35,958 --> 00:04:36,958
We're on the same side.

74
00:04:38,041 --> 00:04:39,291
Family. Family.

75
00:04:40,625 --> 00:04:41,625
Xiaofan.

76
00:04:41,833 --> 00:04:43,750
Whether it's your brother
or you who wants in.

77
00:04:44,375 --> 00:04:46,083
Since everything's all ready for you,

78
00:04:46,541 --> 00:04:48,708
feel free to use it.

79
00:04:49,583 --> 00:04:51,250
Funds aren't a problem.

80
00:04:51,416 --> 00:04:52,416
Don't worry.

81
00:04:52,708 --> 00:04:54,583
If you need more, I'll personally cover it.

82
00:05:02,125 --> 00:05:02,708
Mr. Lu.

83
00:05:03,083 --> 00:05:04,083
There's really no need.

84
00:05:05,625 --> 00:05:06,705
What's the matter with you?

85
00:05:07,583 --> 00:05:09,541
This is Mr. Lu's kindness.

86
00:05:10,208 --> 00:05:11,875
If you can use it is one thing,

87
00:05:12,041 --> 00:05:13,165
appreciating his gesture is quite another.

88
00:05:13,166 --> 00:05:14,375
How can you be so clueless?

89
00:05:20,250 --> 00:05:20,750
Mr. Lu.

90
00:05:20,833 --> 00:05:23,375
Let me thank you on Xiaofan's behalf.

91
00:05:24,125 --> 00:05:25,165
You two go ahead and talk.

92
00:05:25,500 --> 00:05:28,207
I have things to attend to. I'll be off.

93
00:05:28,208 --> 00:05:29,375
Hey, hey, hey.

94
00:05:30,750 --> 00:05:31,333
Let me see you out.

95
00:05:31,500 --> 00:05:32,500
Ah.

96
00:05:32,791 --> 00:05:33,791
We already said

97
00:05:35,791 --> 00:05:36,871
we're all on the same team.

98
00:05:39,375 --> 00:05:40,375
Take care.

99
00:05:41,916 --> 00:05:43,083
Take care, Mr. Lu.

100
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:49,208
Have you lost your mind?

101
00:05:50,166 --> 00:05:51,291
That was Lu Tao.

102
00:05:52,291 --> 00:05:53,540
He'll get you into the VIP trading suite

103
00:05:53,541 --> 00:05:55,166
and front you funds,

104
00:05:55,416 --> 00:05:57,208
He's only doing this for Uncle Bei.

105
00:05:57,833 --> 00:05:59,374
He's picking you to get rich.

106
00:05:59,375 --> 00:06:01,125
He's practically throwing money at you.

107
00:06:02,208 --> 00:06:03,833
I'm getting divorced from Lüxin.

108
00:06:04,708 --> 00:06:06,388
How can I still trade on Uncle Bei's name?

109
00:06:07,791 --> 00:06:08,791
Besides,

110
00:06:09,083 --> 00:06:10,541
you've got nothing to repay him,

111
00:06:11,166 --> 00:06:12,446
yet you want to reap his favors.

112
00:06:12,750 --> 00:06:13,750
How does that look?

113
00:06:14,208 --> 00:06:15,541
You are just... unbelievable.

114
00:06:19,375 --> 00:06:20,749
Give me that tiny phone.

115
00:06:20,750 --> 00:06:21,750
I need to make a call.

116
00:06:21,833 --> 00:06:22,250
It's gone.

117
00:06:22,375 --> 00:06:23,375
What?

118
00:06:24,416 --> 00:06:26,166
You lost such a good thing.

119
00:06:29,416 --> 00:06:30,416
Lost it.

120
00:06:31,583 --> 00:06:32,583
All gone.

121
00:06:39,500 --> 00:06:40,500
Xiaofan.

122
00:06:40,708 --> 00:06:42,416
No need to visit weekly,

123
00:06:42,541 --> 00:06:43,958
once a month is enough.

124
00:06:44,375 --> 00:06:44,916
Section Chief.

125
00:06:45,125 --> 00:06:46,375
That's against the rules.

126
00:06:47,291 --> 00:06:48,707
If you hit any snags over there,

127
00:06:48,708 --> 00:06:49,750
just come to me.

128
00:06:49,875 --> 00:06:50,625
Our office

129
00:06:50,626 --> 00:06:52,208
is technically their superior.

130
00:06:54,583 --> 00:06:55,583
Thank you, Section Chief.

131
00:06:56,208 --> 00:06:57,833
It's fine, Xiaofan.

132
00:06:58,166 --> 00:06:59,625
Tell me the truth.

133
00:07:00,375 --> 00:07:02,541
It's not us treating you wrong, is it?

134
00:07:02,875 --> 00:07:04,315
It's really not that, Section Chief.

135
00:07:04,416 --> 00:07:05,416
It's completely

136
00:07:05,750 --> 00:07:07,333
my own business.

137
00:07:09,125 --> 00:07:10,125
Alright.

138
00:07:10,541 --> 00:07:11,583
That's a relief.

139
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:17,707
[Train Station]

140
00:07:43,833 --> 00:07:44,833
Hello?

141
00:07:45,750 --> 00:07:46,750
Xiaofan,

142
00:07:46,791 --> 00:07:48,125
I'm heading to Lingang next week.

143
00:07:49,750 --> 00:07:50,750
Mm.

144
00:07:51,333 --> 00:07:52,916
How's work treating you over there?

145
00:07:54,250 --> 00:07:54,958
Mm.

146
00:07:55,083 --> 00:07:56,483
Everyone's been looking out for me.

147
00:07:57,041 --> 00:07:58,375
How are your parents?

148
00:07:59,750 --> 00:08:01,333
Mm… All's well with them.

149
00:08:02,708 --> 00:08:04,333
I'll be near your workplace.

150
00:08:04,666 --> 00:08:05,666
Let's grab a meal.

151
00:08:08,666 --> 00:08:09,666
Lüqing…

152
00:08:11,167 --> 00:08:13,000
How's Wenxi?

153
00:09:04,541 --> 00:09:05,708
Hello, Miss Xu.

154
00:09:05,791 --> 00:09:07,166
I'm Lu Xiaofan.

155
00:09:07,541 --> 00:09:08,125
I am...

156
00:09:08,333 --> 00:09:09,333
I know who you are.

157
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:21,833
Hey, where have you been?

158
00:09:21,834 --> 00:09:23,074
I've been waiting ages for you.

159
00:09:26,250 --> 00:09:27,625
I met with Lu Tao today.

160
00:09:29,541 --> 00:09:30,708
Why did you go see him?

161
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:32,707
Lu Tao agreed to bring
us in on the business,

162
00:09:32,708 --> 00:09:34,750
and he's putting up
300,000 as our initial capital.

163
00:09:36,041 --> 00:09:36,500
No.

164
00:09:36,916 --> 00:09:37,916
What if we take a loss?

165
00:09:38,750 --> 00:09:39,957
He guaranteed it right then.

166
00:09:39,958 --> 00:09:41,791
Have you ever heard of
a bookie losing money?

167
00:09:42,375 --> 00:09:43,416
Uncle Bei always said

168
00:09:43,833 --> 00:09:45,000
securities are investments,

169
00:09:45,333 --> 00:09:46,166
not gambling.
Bullshit.

170
00:09:47,208 --> 00:09:48,625
To us, it's gambling.

171
00:09:48,666 --> 00:09:49,833
Are you stupid?

172
00:09:53,750 --> 00:09:55,166
Have you lost your mind?

173
00:09:55,500 --> 00:09:57,375
People would beg for a shot like this.

174
00:09:57,833 --> 00:09:59,000
Didn't Lu Tao say

175
00:09:59,375 --> 00:10:00,708
he'd only do it if I joined?

176
00:10:02,458 --> 00:10:04,416
He could strike it rich all by himself,

177
00:10:04,708 --> 00:10:06,028
yet he insists on bringing us in.

178
00:10:06,708 --> 00:10:08,348
He's trying to cozy up to the Bei family.

179
00:10:08,708 --> 00:10:10,541
You wanna make this cash? Go ahead.

180
00:10:10,875 --> 00:10:11,875
Count me out.

181
00:10:23,208 --> 00:10:24,958
You're new here and not up to speed yet.

182
00:10:25,125 --> 00:10:26,125
I'll handle it.

183
00:10:28,541 --> 00:10:29,083
What's going on?

184
00:10:29,125 --> 00:10:30,125
Take a look.

185
00:10:30,750 --> 00:10:31,750
This part here.

186
00:10:58,541 --> 00:10:59,541
Xiaofan.

187
00:10:59,791 --> 00:11:01,833
What've you been up to after work lately?

188
00:11:02,333 --> 00:11:04,916
I've had family stuff going on lately.

189
00:11:06,708 --> 00:11:07,750
Well.

190
00:11:07,875 --> 00:11:10,583
Come have dinner with me this weekend.

191
00:11:14,083 --> 00:11:16,250
So the rumors are all true.

192
00:11:17,875 --> 00:11:18,875
Yes.

193
00:11:19,916 --> 00:11:20,996
I don't want to lie to you.

194
00:11:21,416 --> 00:11:23,875
So you were never actually married.

195
00:11:24,291 --> 00:11:25,500
No real feelings,

196
00:11:25,541 --> 00:11:26,708
no real married life.

197
00:11:28,416 --> 00:11:29,832
You've chosen to build a new life,

198
00:11:29,833 --> 00:11:30,953
and that takes real bravery.

199
00:11:31,875 --> 00:11:32,875
Brave?

200
00:11:34,333 --> 00:11:36,500
No one's ever called me brave before.

201
00:11:51,166 --> 00:11:52,166
Fanfan.

202
00:11:54,041 --> 00:11:55,541
Can we go back to how we used to be?

203
00:11:58,333 --> 00:12:00,958
Your new life's only just
started. Take your time.

204
00:12:09,541 --> 00:12:11,000
Thanks for dinner tonight.

205
00:12:11,208 --> 00:12:12,958
Alright then, see you tomorrow, Xiaofan.

206
00:12:29,208 --> 00:12:30,875
This area still requires revisions.

207
00:12:32,166 --> 00:12:33,708
The calibers are roughly identical.

208
00:12:34,083 --> 00:12:34,375
So

209
00:12:34,376 --> 00:12:36,124
We just need to tweak this part.

210
00:12:36,125 --> 00:12:36,708
And it'll be fine.
Yep, that works.

211
00:12:37,500 --> 00:12:38,500
Either way is fine.

212
00:12:39,083 --> 00:12:40,166
Do it like this.

213
00:12:43,375 --> 00:12:44,767
Let's go with this approach for now.

214
00:12:44,791 --> 00:12:45,874
We'll show you

215
00:12:45,875 --> 00:12:47,275
once we finish adjusting this part.

216
00:12:48,541 --> 00:12:49,541
Xiaofan.

217
00:12:49,830 --> 00:12:50,830
Xiaofan.

218
00:12:51,208 --> 00:12:52,208
Why are you running away?

219
00:12:52,791 --> 00:12:53,333
Director Li.

220
00:12:53,583 --> 00:12:54,875
Let's wrap it up here for today.

221
00:12:55,208 --> 00:12:56,517
I'm going to have dinner with my family.

222
00:12:56,541 --> 00:12:57,707
When you're free,

223
00:12:57,708 --> 00:12:58,976
let's drink to our hearts' content.

224
00:12:59,000 --> 00:12:59,416
Here.

225
00:12:59,875 --> 00:13:00,875
Your bro.

226
00:13:01,750 --> 00:13:02,750
Bro.

227
00:13:06,375 --> 00:13:07,375
Lüqing.

228
00:13:07,583 --> 00:13:09,708
Why did your family buy so much land?

229
00:13:10,083 --> 00:13:11,041
If you ask me,

230
00:13:11,083 --> 00:13:12,083
we could sink that cash

231
00:13:12,250 --> 00:13:14,916
into a couple of huge stock plays instead.

232
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:17,875
You wanna talk about Langjian, don't you?

233
00:13:18,541 --> 00:13:19,875
I'm not interested right now.

234
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:21,208
Think it through.

235
00:13:21,708 --> 00:13:22,708
This single deal

236
00:13:22,916 --> 00:13:25,125
beats years of our earnings.

237
00:13:26,625 --> 00:13:27,791
Watch your own back.

238
00:13:28,083 --> 00:13:29,208
Don't get yourself burned.

239
00:13:33,208 --> 00:13:33,791
Xiaofan.

240
00:13:34,166 --> 00:13:36,333
Lüqing rarely comes out to Lingang.

241
00:13:36,541 --> 00:13:37,625
Let's grab a bite together.

242
00:13:41,208 --> 00:13:42,728
I've got client business to attend to.

243
00:13:43,166 --> 00:13:44,707
Which big shot client of yours?

244
00:13:44,708 --> 00:13:45,708
Drop the name.

245
00:13:45,750 --> 00:13:47,916
Let me see who this nobody is.

246
00:13:51,333 --> 00:13:52,333
Forget it.

247
00:14:02,708 --> 00:14:03,708
Lu Xiaofan!

248
00:14:03,833 --> 00:14:05,875
Are you really cutting
all ties with the Beis?

249
00:14:09,500 --> 00:14:10,500
Lu Xiaofan.

250
00:14:10,666 --> 00:14:12,546
Don't tell me you've
suddenly grown a backbone.

251
00:14:14,083 --> 00:14:15,457
All these years, the Lus

252
00:14:15,458 --> 00:14:17,184
have ridden the golden
son-in-law's coattails

253
00:14:17,208 --> 00:14:18,208
and gained all the perks.

254
00:14:18,708 --> 00:14:20,166
Lose those privileges,

255
00:14:20,416 --> 00:14:22,208
and you're right back to square one.

256
00:14:22,958 --> 00:14:24,375
It's like plummeting off this roof,

257
00:14:24,666 --> 00:14:25,916
crashing with a thud,

258
00:14:26,333 --> 00:14:27,416
shattered to pieces,

259
00:14:27,708 --> 00:14:29,291
then everyone tramples you.

260
00:14:29,708 --> 00:14:30,791
Think hard about it.

261
00:15:01,291 --> 00:15:01,958
Lu Xiaofan!
What did you do?

262
00:15:02,959 --> 00:15:04,207
A girl's outside for you.

263
00:15:04,208 --> 00:15:05,666
She came in sobbing nonstop.

264
00:15:06,083 --> 00:15:06,500
Huh?

265
00:15:06,833 --> 00:15:07,833
Who's she?

266
00:15:08,083 --> 00:15:08,916
Come here, come here.
I got through.

267
00:15:10,583 --> 00:15:12,166
Xiaofan, where are you?

268
00:15:12,416 --> 00:15:13,416
It's me, Xiaofeng.

269
00:15:14,208 --> 00:15:15,208
Xiaofeng?

270
00:15:15,625 --> 00:15:16,916
What brings you here?

271
00:15:18,541 --> 00:15:20,208
Your brother, Lu Xiaoping...

272
00:15:20,625 --> 00:15:22,541
He knocked me up and then took off.

273
00:15:23,541 --> 00:15:25,624
I showed up at your house
on my knees begging your mom.

274
00:15:25,625 --> 00:15:27,708
She refused to say where he'd gone.

275
00:15:28,041 --> 00:15:29,416
I ran out of options.

276
00:15:29,625 --> 00:15:31,083
I snuck into your house,

277
00:15:32,375 --> 00:15:33,375
and in a cabinet,

278
00:15:34,166 --> 00:15:35,166
I found this.

279
00:15:35,541 --> 00:15:36,653
And that's how I tracked you down.

280
00:15:36,677 --> 00:15:38,544
[Bank transfer receipts]

281
00:15:39,375 --> 00:15:40,375
Xiaofan.

282
00:15:40,541 --> 00:15:42,166
Lu Xiaoping can't ditch me.

283
00:15:42,541 --> 00:15:43,541
I understand.

284
00:15:43,916 --> 00:15:45,436
Let me get you something to eat first.

285
00:15:45,750 --> 00:15:46,750
Xiaofan.

286
00:15:46,791 --> 00:15:47,500
I'm begging you.
Please help me.

287
00:15:48,666 --> 00:15:49,208
I'm begging you.

288
00:15:49,209 --> 00:15:50,499
You've gotta help me find him.

289
00:15:50,500 --> 00:15:50,875
Xiaofeng.

290
00:15:51,000 --> 00:15:52,000
Xiaofeng, get up first.

291
00:15:52,625 --> 00:15:53,083
Here's the plan.

292
00:15:53,416 --> 00:15:54,416
You get some rest first.

293
00:15:54,958 --> 00:15:55,208
I'll...

294
00:15:55,750 --> 00:15:56,750
I'll think of something.

295
00:16:04,416 --> 00:16:05,736
Why'd you take forever to answer?

296
00:16:06,333 --> 00:16:07,458
Is Xiaofeng with you?

297
00:16:07,750 --> 00:16:08,208
No.
Hey...

298
00:16:08,875 --> 00:16:09,375
Xiaofan.

299
00:16:09,833 --> 00:16:10,958
Can I ask you for a favor?

300
00:16:11,375 --> 00:16:12,375
I can't help with this.

301
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:13,708
Xiaofan.

302
00:16:13,750 --> 00:16:15,082
I'm about to get engaged to Weiwei.

303
00:16:15,083 --> 00:16:17,000
Word's spread all over the bureau.

304
00:16:17,083 --> 00:16:18,541
My full-time post is on the line.

305
00:16:18,708 --> 00:16:19,708
If she turns up now,

306
00:16:19,750 --> 00:16:20,999
I'm done for.

307
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:22,999
Why get Xiaofeng pregnant?

308
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:23,541
Hey...

309
00:16:23,958 --> 00:16:25,290
I didn't mean to.

310
00:16:25,291 --> 00:16:26,291
Well...

311
00:16:26,375 --> 00:16:28,375
I just got drunk with friends that night.

312
00:16:28,541 --> 00:16:29,083
You know.

313
00:16:29,084 --> 00:16:30,540
She's always looked up to me.

314
00:16:30,541 --> 00:16:31,541
She threw herself at me.

315
00:16:31,708 --> 00:16:33,958
One small mistake and this happened.

316
00:16:34,291 --> 00:16:35,958
I'd never go for Xiaofeng.

317
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:37,124
She didn't even finish middle school.

318
00:16:37,125 --> 00:16:38,583
I'm a college graduate!

319
00:16:39,041 --> 00:16:39,958
She's just a farmer.

320
00:16:39,959 --> 00:16:41,082
I'm gonna make it big.

321
00:16:41,083 --> 00:16:42,541
No way that'd ever work.

322
00:16:42,708 --> 00:16:43,708
This woman...

323
00:16:44,291 --> 00:16:46,083
has no self-awareness at all.

324
00:16:46,375 --> 00:16:46,916
Right.

325
00:16:47,250 --> 00:16:48,541
She's nobody.

326
00:16:48,708 --> 00:16:49,791
She's beneath you.

327
00:16:50,125 --> 00:16:52,041
If you never wanted a life with her,

328
00:16:52,375 --> 00:16:53,833
why lead her on?

329
00:16:54,166 --> 00:16:55,125
Why make her think

330
00:16:55,126 --> 00:16:56,416
you'd spend your life with her?

331
00:16:56,916 --> 00:16:58,958
Lu Xiaoping, you bastard.

332
00:17:05,625 --> 00:17:06,791
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

333
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:08,000
I am a bastard.

334
00:17:08,083 --> 00:17:08,583
Xiaofan.

335
00:17:09,041 --> 00:17:11,000
You've gotta help me out no matter what.

336
00:17:11,291 --> 00:17:12,851
Convince Xiaofeng to abort immediately.

337
00:17:13,125 --> 00:17:14,875
I'll wire the abortion money right away.

338
00:17:15,375 --> 00:17:16,767
I'll pay her extra compensation too.

339
00:17:16,791 --> 00:17:18,208
Who cares about your crummy money?

340
00:17:19,208 --> 00:17:21,333
You're a terrible scumbag.

341
00:17:21,708 --> 00:17:22,875
I'll never forgive you.

342
00:17:42,166 --> 00:17:43,166
Xiaofan.

343
00:17:44,041 --> 00:17:45,041
Tell me.

344
00:17:45,416 --> 00:17:47,333
How can I win Pingping back?

345
00:17:48,041 --> 00:17:49,041
Xiaofeng.

346
00:17:49,375 --> 00:17:50,375
Take it easy first.

347
00:17:51,041 --> 00:17:51,750
This

348
00:17:51,875 --> 00:17:53,125
will all work out.

349
00:17:55,583 --> 00:17:56,625
So tell me,

350
00:17:57,333 --> 00:17:59,583
if he breaks up with that city girl,

351
00:18:00,291 --> 00:18:01,541
will he come back to me?

352
00:18:12,166 --> 00:18:13,625
Just head back, Xiaofan.

353
00:18:14,250 --> 00:18:15,333
I need some rest.

354
00:18:16,125 --> 00:18:17,125
Xiaofeng.

355
00:18:17,208 --> 00:18:17,833
Don't worry.

356
00:18:18,208 --> 00:18:19,375
I'll find a way, I promise.

357
00:18:20,208 --> 00:18:21,291
Get some good rest first.

358
00:18:21,625 --> 00:18:22,985
I'll see you first thing tomorrow.

359
00:18:41,416 --> 00:18:42,624
You've got the wrong guy.

360
00:18:42,625 --> 00:18:43,625
I don't know you.

361
00:18:44,125 --> 00:18:45,333
You're Xiaofeng, aren't you?

362
00:18:46,208 --> 00:18:47,582
Wanna get back at Lu Xiaoping?

363
00:18:47,583 --> 00:18:48,583
Let me in.

364
00:18:49,083 --> 00:18:50,083
Let's talk.

365
00:18:57,041 --> 00:18:58,041
Xiaofeng.

366
00:19:01,916 --> 00:19:02,916
Hello.

367
00:19:03,625 --> 00:19:05,000
Where's the girl from Room 215?

368
00:19:05,875 --> 00:19:06,875
Room 215?

369
00:19:07,333 --> 00:19:08,333
Room 215.

370
00:19:08,541 --> 00:19:09,601
She checked out early this morning.

371
00:19:09,625 --> 00:19:11,705
She asked directions to
the Textile Bureau, I think.

372
00:19:12,541 --> 00:19:13,000
Thank you.

373
00:19:13,333 --> 00:19:14,333
No problem.

374
00:19:17,416 --> 00:19:20,416
I only inspect your department once a year.

375
00:19:20,750 --> 00:19:22,708
What a disgrace, Director Ding!

376
00:19:24,208 --> 00:19:25,374
Everyone, please go inside.

377
00:19:25,375 --> 00:19:26,875
Let's sit down and sort this out.

378
00:19:27,166 --> 00:19:28,750
You'd better watch yourself.

379
00:19:32,125 --> 00:19:33,583
No need. You can go.

380
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:35,166
I got what I wanted.

381
00:19:35,541 --> 00:19:36,000
I won't trouble you further.

382
00:19:36,001 --> 00:19:37,500
Lu Xiaoping, what have you done?

383
00:19:37,875 --> 00:19:38,875
Get in here!

384
00:19:49,208 --> 00:19:50,208
Xiaofeng.

385
00:19:50,750 --> 00:19:51,790
Sorry for all the trouble.

386
00:19:52,541 --> 00:19:53,541
Xiaofeng.

387
00:19:53,583 --> 00:19:54,916
Let me get you settled first.

388
00:19:55,583 --> 00:19:56,583
No need.

389
00:19:56,666 --> 00:19:57,666
I'm leaving now.

390
00:19:58,041 --> 00:19:59,041
Xiaofeng.

391
00:19:59,208 --> 00:20:00,488
Why go through all this trouble?

392
00:20:01,791 --> 00:20:03,416
I don't care if he doesn't like me.

393
00:20:04,208 --> 00:20:06,208
The mere thought of
me will fill him with hatred,

394
00:20:06,541 --> 00:20:07,541
make his legs shake,

395
00:20:08,000 --> 00:20:09,000
and haunt him forever.

396
00:20:16,708 --> 00:20:17,788
He's the one who ruined me!

397
00:20:17,916 --> 00:20:19,476
He took Xiaofeng to stir up trouble,
and it's all his fault.

398
00:20:19,500 --> 00:20:20,833
What's that got to do with me?

399
00:20:22,500 --> 00:20:24,333
I never knew she'd head to your office.

400
00:20:24,541 --> 00:20:25,541
Then tell me,

401
00:20:25,791 --> 00:20:27,540
how did she find my workplace?

402
00:20:27,541 --> 00:20:29,125
If you didn't tell her, who else?

403
00:20:29,291 --> 00:20:31,374
You're useless, hounding
the Beis for a divorce.

404
00:20:31,375 --> 00:20:31,958
You can't stand me

405
00:20:31,959 --> 00:20:33,517
marrying an executive's daughter, right?

406
00:20:33,541 --> 00:20:35,083
You did this on purpose, didn't you?

407
00:20:35,875 --> 00:20:38,000
You make no progress but blame others.

408
00:20:38,250 --> 00:20:39,750
How many times did I tell you

409
00:20:40,208 --> 00:20:42,165
to stay away from her?

410
00:20:42,166 --> 00:20:42,875
Did you even listen?
Mom, I'm ruined.

411
00:20:43,791 --> 00:20:44,708
I've lost everything.
My job,

412
00:20:45,376 --> 00:20:46,707
my marriage, all of it.

413
00:20:46,708 --> 00:20:47,957
My life's over, Mom.

414
00:20:47,958 --> 00:20:48,958
You deserve it.

415
00:20:49,291 --> 00:20:50,851
You won't improve, who you gonna blame?

416
00:20:52,333 --> 00:20:53,333
This whole thing

417
00:20:53,666 --> 00:20:55,166
was Xiaofan's fault too.

418
00:20:55,791 --> 00:20:57,791
Xiaofeng turning up at your workplace…

419
00:20:57,916 --> 00:20:59,791
How could you be so reckless?

420
00:21:00,041 --> 00:21:01,601
Letting her find out about
someone else's workplace.

421
00:21:01,625 --> 00:21:03,625
You're betraying your own people!

422
00:21:04,375 --> 00:21:05,208
Cut it out.

423
00:21:05,375 --> 00:21:06,775
What's Xiaofan got to do with this?

424
00:21:06,833 --> 00:21:08,625
We've troubled Xiaofan plenty already.

425
00:21:11,500 --> 00:21:13,500
It's his own fault for turning out useless.

426
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:15,000
We've just had bad luck.

427
00:21:18,916 --> 00:21:19,916
Xiaofan.

428
00:21:21,040 --> 00:21:21,750
Let your brother

429
00:21:21,875 --> 00:21:23,500
bunk with you for the time being.

430
00:21:24,125 --> 00:21:25,750
Wait till he gets a job, then we'll see.

431
00:21:26,375 --> 00:21:27,375
Mom.

432
00:21:27,416 --> 00:21:29,541
My schooling's nowhere near enough.

433
00:21:30,291 --> 00:21:31,582
I'm a civil servant,

434
00:21:31,583 --> 00:21:32,903
I've got no way to find new work.

435
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:37,000
Xiaofan.

436
00:21:37,458 --> 00:21:39,178
Are you still in touch with the Bei family?

437
00:21:39,708 --> 00:21:40,708
No, not at all.

438
00:21:42,708 --> 00:21:44,348
Don't you have Bei Lüqing's phone number?

439
00:21:50,041 --> 00:21:51,082
You're such a weakling.

440
00:21:51,083 --> 00:21:52,541
You're always trouble.

441
00:21:53,958 --> 00:21:55,916
How can you just stand by?

442
00:22:03,583 --> 00:22:04,583
I'll give it a try.

443
00:22:19,750 --> 00:22:20,750
Hello.

444
00:22:22,500 --> 00:22:23,500
Who is this.

445
00:22:26,583 --> 00:22:27,583
Who?

446
00:22:28,000 --> 00:22:29,000
It's...

447
00:22:29,041 --> 00:22:30,041
it's me.

448
00:22:30,416 --> 00:22:31,416
Lu Xiaofan.

449
00:22:35,208 --> 00:22:37,041
You said you were busy two days ago.

450
00:22:37,708 --> 00:22:38,708
I wanna ask,

451
00:22:39,083 --> 00:22:41,041
do you have any time as of late?

452
00:22:41,916 --> 00:22:42,916
No.

453
00:22:58,375 --> 00:22:59,375
Mom.

454
00:22:59,708 --> 00:23:01,083
Dad should be home by now, right?

455
00:23:01,541 --> 00:23:02,625
Probably.

456
00:23:02,708 --> 00:23:03,583
It takes three days by train,
one day by bus.

457
00:23:04,708 --> 00:23:06,083
He'll call you when he's there.

458
00:23:08,458 --> 00:23:09,458
Mom.

459
00:23:10,875 --> 00:23:11,875
You still have to work.

460
00:23:12,208 --> 00:23:13,208
I hardly eat at home.

461
00:23:13,250 --> 00:23:14,250
It's fine.

462
00:23:17,208 --> 00:23:18,208
Mom.

463
00:23:18,583 --> 00:23:19,625
The food's gone sour!

464
00:23:20,125 --> 00:23:20,875
I know.

465
00:23:20,876 --> 00:23:22,208
Just a little.

466
00:23:22,291 --> 00:23:23,931
I soaked it in boiling water a few times.

467
00:23:24,625 --> 00:23:25,583
There's no well water here.

468
00:23:25,584 --> 00:23:26,749
It can't hold much food.

469
00:23:26,750 --> 00:23:27,832
I'll get diarrhea if I eat this.

470
00:23:27,833 --> 00:23:28,958
You're not that delicate.

471
00:23:30,541 --> 00:23:31,083
I'll go eat out.
Lu Xiaofan, you got cash?

472
00:23:32,333 --> 00:23:32,708
Yes.

473
00:23:33,166 --> 00:23:34,926
Give me some money,
I'll go out for noodles.

474
00:23:35,291 --> 00:23:36,491
Don't you have your own money?

475
00:23:37,875 --> 00:23:39,208
No job, no money.

476
00:23:41,708 --> 00:23:43,375
Noodles aren't that expensive.

477
00:23:44,333 --> 00:23:45,333
Forget it.

478
00:23:53,750 --> 00:23:54,750
Mom.

479
00:23:55,083 --> 00:23:56,083
What's wrong?

480
00:24:06,041 --> 00:24:07,041
It's nothing.

481
00:24:07,125 --> 00:24:08,125
Let's eat.

482
00:24:15,583 --> 00:24:16,833
It's about brother, isn't it?

483
00:24:20,708 --> 00:24:21,708
Fanfan.

484
00:24:23,333 --> 00:24:24,373
It's not that I want to...

485
00:24:28,000 --> 00:24:29,208
I don't mean to trouble you.

486
00:24:30,708 --> 00:24:31,708
I'm afraid

487
00:24:32,000 --> 00:24:34,166
if your brother doesn't get a proper job,

488
00:24:34,750 --> 00:24:36,208
he'll go to waste.

489
00:24:39,916 --> 00:24:40,916
Mom.

490
00:24:44,750 --> 00:24:46,250
I'll go ask the Beis again.

491
00:24:48,291 --> 00:24:49,375
Don't worry about it.

492
00:24:50,916 --> 00:24:51,916
If all else fails,

493
00:24:53,291 --> 00:24:54,708
wait till Mr. Bei's back.

494
00:25:15,333 --> 00:25:16,851
I'm set to meet Xiao Wu
from the Textile Bureau.

495
00:25:16,875 --> 00:25:17,875
Tonight at eight.

496
00:25:18,541 --> 00:25:20,061
If you can't make it, no need to come.

497
00:25:20,625 --> 00:25:21,625
Okay.

498
00:25:38,083 --> 00:25:38,833
Long time no see!

499
00:25:38,834 --> 00:25:40,166
Xiaofan, have a seat.

500
00:25:49,291 --> 00:25:50,291
Bro.

501
00:25:51,875 --> 00:25:52,875
What's up?

502
00:25:53,875 --> 00:25:54,875
It's

503
00:25:55,625 --> 00:25:57,208
about my brother.

504
00:25:57,541 --> 00:25:58,250
Your brother.

505
00:25:58,333 --> 00:25:59,875
Your brother's doing really well now.

506
00:26:00,208 --> 00:26:01,000
Exactly.

507
00:26:01,083 --> 00:26:02,207
Folks asking him for favors

508
00:26:02,208 --> 00:26:04,708
waiting months just to see him.

509
00:26:05,666 --> 00:26:05,958
No.

510
00:26:06,208 --> 00:26:07,291
Not Lüqing.

511
00:26:07,958 --> 00:26:09,083
My eldest brother.

512
00:26:09,416 --> 00:26:10,416
He...

513
00:26:10,625 --> 00:26:11,625
He's out of a job.

514
00:26:13,083 --> 00:26:13,500
Oh.

515
00:26:14,083 --> 00:26:15,750
You mean your brother

516
00:26:16,000 --> 00:26:18,124
who got that girl pregnant

517
00:26:18,125 --> 00:26:19,685
and tried to duck his responsibilities?

518
00:26:21,375 --> 00:26:23,583
He… He knows he messed up.

519
00:26:24,916 --> 00:26:26,125
Lu Xiaofan.

520
00:26:26,458 --> 00:26:27,583
You come here out of nowhere

521
00:26:27,666 --> 00:26:29,125
and dump this mess on us.

522
00:26:29,291 --> 00:26:30,375
Getting someone a job

523
00:26:30,708 --> 00:26:31,416
is no big deal.
Piece of cake.

524
00:26:32,708 --> 00:26:33,500
Thing is,

525
00:26:33,501 --> 00:26:35,708
your Lu family produced such a creep.

526
00:26:36,041 --> 00:26:37,416
Decent folks steer clear of him.

527
00:26:37,958 --> 00:26:40,125
Who'd volunteer to step in shit?

528
00:26:41,208 --> 00:26:42,624
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

529
00:26:42,625 --> 00:26:43,625
I'll be going now.

530
00:26:54,041 --> 00:26:55,291
Pick out the fish roe for me.

531
00:26:57,375 --> 00:26:58,375
Mm.

532
00:26:59,916 --> 00:27:00,916
Look at you,

533
00:27:01,041 --> 00:27:02,521
still so quick to fly off the handle.

534
00:27:02,708 --> 00:27:03,708
Your Brother Yang

535
00:27:03,750 --> 00:27:05,458
ordered two servings of uni sashimi.

536
00:27:05,708 --> 00:27:07,208
All ordered just for you.

537
00:27:08,750 --> 00:27:09,916
You pull this stunt,

538
00:27:09,958 --> 00:27:11,438
and you think two uni fix everything?

539
00:27:15,541 --> 00:27:16,665
I was just sticking up for what's right.

540
00:27:16,666 --> 00:27:17,934
I can't stand men who desert their lovers.

541
00:27:17,958 --> 00:27:19,165
Who'd have thought

542
00:27:19,166 --> 00:27:21,291
the heartless jerk was Xiaofan's brother?

543
00:27:21,583 --> 00:27:22,583
Xiaofan.

544
00:27:22,958 --> 00:27:24,416
I'll level with you too.

545
00:27:25,000 --> 00:27:26,207
That woman your brother knocked up

546
00:27:26,208 --> 00:27:27,624
filed a municipal complaint yesterday.

547
00:27:27,625 --> 00:27:29,375
And I ran right into her.

548
00:27:29,791 --> 00:27:32,291
I told her the mayor's
visiting the Textile Bureau.

549
00:27:33,500 --> 00:27:35,541
You won't hold this against me, right?

550
00:27:39,000 --> 00:27:39,416
No.

551
00:27:39,833 --> 00:27:41,041
He's the one at fault.

552
00:27:42,291 --> 00:27:43,333
What did I tell you!

553
00:27:43,625 --> 00:27:45,540
Xiaofan's great,

554
00:27:45,541 --> 00:27:46,749
so reasonable

555
00:27:46,750 --> 00:27:48,000
and thoughtful.

556
00:27:48,266 --> 00:27:50,333
I told you he
wouldn't get upset.

557
00:27:50,416 --> 00:27:51,416
If he'd gotten mad,

558
00:27:51,583 --> 00:27:52,916
it'd make us feel like strangers.

559
00:27:56,125 --> 00:27:57,375
Hello, what can I get you?

560
00:27:57,791 --> 00:27:59,082
Bring us two more of these.

561
00:27:59,083 --> 00:28:00,083
Certainly.

562
00:28:01,041 --> 00:28:03,583
Why get so much sushi and tempura?

563
00:28:04,375 --> 00:28:06,166
Just making you spend more, right?

564
00:28:06,791 --> 00:28:07,791
Hey, come on.

565
00:28:14,708 --> 00:28:15,948
Go buy me a pack of cigarettes.

566
00:28:25,416 --> 00:28:26,625
What's wrong, young master?

567
00:28:29,375 --> 00:28:31,500
Didn't you meet Xiaofeng
at the municipal committee?

568
00:28:32,916 --> 00:28:34,374
I just wanted

569
00:28:34,375 --> 00:28:35,535
to set you and Lu Xiaofan up.

570
00:28:35,625 --> 00:28:36,041
Hey.

571
00:28:36,375 --> 00:28:37,083
Look at you.

572
00:28:37,375 --> 00:28:39,416
Ever since Lu Xiaofan left,

573
00:28:39,583 --> 00:28:41,291
I've never seen you smile this much.

574
00:28:41,916 --> 00:28:43,791
You sort out Lu Xiaoping's job then.

575
00:28:44,791 --> 00:28:45,831
Alright, alright, alright.

576
00:28:46,000 --> 00:28:47,520
Haven't I sorted every single one out?

577
00:28:47,708 --> 00:28:49,308
No need for Master Bei to lift a finger.

578
00:28:50,208 --> 00:28:51,208
One more thing.

579
00:28:51,500 --> 00:28:52,750
From now on, no harm to the Lus

580
00:28:53,333 --> 00:28:55,208
without my word.

581
00:29:09,791 --> 00:29:10,791
Get this packed to go.

582
00:29:12,375 --> 00:29:12,750
Bro.

583
00:29:13,250 --> 00:29:14,250
No need.

584
00:29:16,541 --> 00:29:18,708
Never realized you were
such a smiley person.

585
00:29:19,500 --> 00:29:20,708
Fine, Master Bei.

586
00:29:20,791 --> 00:29:21,791
I'm terrible,
I shouldn't be smiling.

587
00:29:25,125 --> 00:29:26,125
Alright,

588
00:29:26,333 --> 00:29:27,767
I'll get a full set of today's dishes

589
00:29:27,791 --> 00:29:29,082
packed

590
00:29:29,083 --> 00:29:30,582
and send them to Xiaofan's.

591
00:29:30,583 --> 00:29:31,583
Happy now?

592
00:29:31,625 --> 00:29:32,625
Is that all?

593
00:29:33,041 --> 00:29:34,041
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

594
00:29:34,083 --> 00:29:36,500
About Lu Xiaoping's job,

595
00:29:36,958 --> 00:29:37,958
I'll take care of it.

596
00:29:41,500 --> 00:29:41,875
Xiaofan.

597
00:29:42,500 --> 00:29:43,700
Aren't you gonna thank Ziyang?

598
00:29:44,166 --> 00:29:45,166
Thank you, Ziyang.

599
00:29:45,250 --> 00:29:45,666
Hey.
Xiaofan.

600
00:29:46,583 --> 00:29:48,333
You flatter me too much.

601
00:29:49,000 --> 00:29:50,000
It's nothing.

602
00:29:50,001 --> 00:29:51,207
That's far too formal a bow.

603
00:29:51,208 --> 00:29:52,208
Waiter.

604
00:29:52,500 --> 00:29:54,333
Bring another round of everything here.

605
00:29:55,500 --> 00:29:56,208
Ziyang.

606
00:29:56,291 --> 00:29:57,291
Don't order anymore.

607
00:29:57,625 --> 00:29:58,905
I can't take all this back home.

608
00:29:59,166 --> 00:30:00,166
Go home?

609
00:30:00,708 --> 00:30:02,708
Think you're going home tonight?

610
00:30:14,000 --> 00:30:15,000
Xiaofan.

611
00:30:15,625 --> 00:30:17,585
Let me tell you something straight from
the heart.

612
00:30:20,125 --> 00:30:21,125
See?

613
00:30:21,750 --> 00:30:23,875
The kind of life you can have, Lu Xiaofan,

614
00:30:24,083 --> 00:30:26,250
depends entirely on that man's mood.

615
00:30:26,750 --> 00:30:28,374
Don't overestimate your worth.

616
00:30:28,375 --> 00:30:30,041
And don't think you matter that much.

617
00:30:30,625 --> 00:30:32,374
Having Lüqing in your corner

618
00:30:32,375 --> 00:30:33,791
is pure luck for you.

619
00:30:34,375 --> 00:30:35,707
You left yesterday,

620
00:30:35,708 --> 00:30:36,908
and you could come back today.

621
00:30:36,958 --> 00:30:37,999
But one day when you leave,

622
00:30:38,000 --> 00:30:39,851
there's no telling if you'll
be able to come back.

623
00:30:39,875 --> 00:30:41,583
Let me put it bluntly.

624
00:30:42,625 --> 00:30:43,750
Better men are out there,

625
00:30:43,958 --> 00:30:45,500
and far more women.

626
00:30:46,541 --> 00:30:46,791
Mm.

627
00:30:47,375 --> 00:30:47,916
Alright.
I'm off.

628
00:30:49,083 --> 00:30:50,166
Thank you, Ziyang.

629
00:30:58,083 --> 00:30:59,603
What nonsense's Ziyang rambling about?

630
00:31:01,250 --> 00:31:02,250
Nothing.

631
00:31:06,791 --> 00:31:07,791
Rest assured.

632
00:31:08,166 --> 00:31:10,416
Lin Ziyang can manage
getting your brother a job.

633
00:31:11,750 --> 00:31:12,916
I... I understand.

634
00:31:20,166 --> 00:31:21,166
Let's go.
